# The build context of site/Dockerfile: the pages, this folder and the sources of the rescue kit. docs/firmware/ and
# docs/rescue/ are where a local build leaves its packages and its kit; the site's packages come from the pinned release
# (site/RELEASE), and its kit from the build.
*
!docs
!site
!rescue
!tools/undertone.py
!tools/undertone_screens.py
!tools/uboot_rescue.py
!tools/uboot_install.py
!tools/pd40_install.py
!tools/pocketx_fw.py
!tools/pd40_recovery.py
!undertone
!undertone.cmd
!RESCUE.bat
!LICENSE
docs/firmware
docs/rescue
**/__pycache__
